# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CAMPAIGN SCRATCH ARTIFACTS (2026-08 agent campaigns, repo root).
#
# These are the NON-CODE products of the a1b/a2/a3/a5-a8, ab, apxaudit, bwd,
# compress, decode..decode6, lean, perf2, pfm, poolgate and tlm3 campaigns:
# compile caches, job output directories, captured pytest stdout and result
# dumps.  The owner already classified this same set as "none of the below is
# code" in .rayignore, which had to exclude it because the tree had grown to
# 1.5 GiB and every --ray-measure job was dying at RuntimeEnvSetupError.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored here: the campaign .py/.sh/.sbatch scripts, which
# ticket 27 moved from the repo root into campaign_scratch/ and committed there
# verbatim.  Those are the only surviving record of how the jobs behind the
# committed results were actually invoked, and this repo has already lost one
# command line that way (job 61494, see tools/gen_fq_launchers.py).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# JAX persistent compile caches (~600 MiB; .jaxcache_perf2 alone is 10391 files)
/.jaxcache_*/

# per-campaign job output directories (*_out, *_out_b, *_out_fine, pool_gate_out)
/*_out*/
!/decode2_out/
/decode2_out/*
# ...except the one log a committed source comment cites by name as the
# provenance of its numbers (src/alphagrad/approx/common/feature_probe.py:72)
!/decode2_out/face_today_sizes.log

# .bak copies of tracked source taken before the 2026-08-15 lean refactor;
# every one of these files is recoverable from git history instead
/lean_backup/

# captured pytest stdout from the lean and pfm before/after gates
/lean_pytest_*.txt
/pfm_pytest_*.txt

# campaign job logs and result dumps at the repo root
/a7_*.out
/a3_probe_rows*.csv
/pfm_m2_nn.txt
/pfm_m3.txt
/pfm_meas_out.txt
/pfm_tlm3.txt

# a scratch dump of `git status` / `git log` left by an agent run
/_agentA_info.txt
